{"cache_key":"c37f0cba163c73f9bdb0f78eaa902b758ace0f793b9a49f0e69d96f4f950ff84","segment_id":"noUsableRoles","source_path":"extensions/openclaw-id-access/browser/i18n/locales/en.ts","src_lang":"en","text":"No roles have a valid member role name. Use 1–64 lowercase letters, digits, - or _, starting with a letter, in gateway.roles.definitions.","text_hash":"ad5072751747191c7d1b7755e5a7b319acb420b33bce7450734a662354e56db3","tgt_lang":"pl","translated":"Żadna z ról nie ma prawidłowej nazwy roli członka. W gateway.roles.definitions użyj od 1 do 64 małych liter, cyfr, znaków - lub _, zaczynając od litery.","updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:21:13.385Z"}
